/* The map readout of the demo panel lives in its own tiny document on purpose (issue #93): RmlUi re-lays out a whole
   document when any text in it changes, and demo.rml holds a 1000-row list (about 12 ms per layout), so a readout
   that changes every 30 frames inside it caused a CPU spike each time. In a document of its own it costs ~0.02 ms.
   The position is tuned to sit after the "Карта:" label of the paragraph in demo.rml. */
div {
    display: block;
}

body {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "PT Sans Caption";
    font-size: 15dp;
    color: $light;
}

#demo-fps {
    position: absolute;
    left: 83dp;
    top: 62dp;
    width: 300dp;
    white-space: nowrap;
}
